lease. The deployment list wasn't in strict order, so I worked this out from the sequence numbers instead. The rollback finished and was verified in all three regions.\n- **Current state:** The service is healthy and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** It describes the failure, the rollback and next steps: keep watching the service and find the root cause in v2.3.1 before deploying it again.", "type": "text"}]}]}